{{!
    @template block_coursectrldates/block_content

    AJAX content placeholder for block_coursectrldates.

    Moodle's block system uses this template when refreshing block content
    via AJAX. The block currently renders all content server-side via
    get_content(); no client-side initialisation is required at this stage.

    Example context (json): {}
}}
